### Query Optimization
- Use appropriate warehouse (TCH_ANALYTICS_WH) for interactive queries
- Leverage Dynamic Table caching for real-time data
- Implement pagination for large result sets
- Use LIMIT clauses for exploratory queries

## User Experience Requirements

### No Placeholder Content
- NEVER display "If you enabled X feature, this is what you would see"
- ALL features must work with live generated data
- Provide helpful examples in UI hints, but never hardcode search terms or filters in backend code

### Multi-Source Value Demonstration
Every major view should clearly demonstrate the value of integrating multiple data sources:
- Clinical outcomes correlation with financial efficiency
- Provider performance correlation with patient engagement
- Cost trends correlation with care quality metrics

